<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jones Medical started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jones Medical started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has started coverage of Jones Medical Industries Inc with a buy recommendation, a market source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Jones closed at 43-1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
